      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "2CO",
          "chapter": 3,
          "verse": 11
        }
      ],
      "en": "For if that which passes away was with glory, much more that which remains is in glory.",
      "ko": "없어질 것도 영광으로 말미암았은즉 길이 있을 것은 더욱 영광 가운데 있느니라",
      "source_text_hash": "0224e72d59f6f97a70f90e5faba1d1703b22c8926c9aa8d3702ad0f8b2a2c326",
      "translation_text_hash": "75463212b4fc109825762e90a42242f8a14d82a0d8493509b531242229c39055",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "없어질 것도 영광으로 말미암았은즉 길이 있을 것은 더욱 영광 가운데 있느니라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "75463212b4fc109825762e90a42242f8a14d82a0d8493509b531242229c39055"
      ]
    },
    {
